:: Kylar Cafe Widgets [widget]
<<widget "kylarCafePresence">>
	<<if $daily.kylarCafe is "visiting">>
		<<if C.npc.Kylar.state isnot "active">>
			<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "left">>
		<<elseif Time.dayState isnot "day">>
			<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "left">>
			<<endevent>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
			Kylar checks the time on <<his>> watch and looks towards the door. "I need to go. They're waiting for me."
			<br><br>
			Before leaving, <<he>> looks at you one last time, then quickly walks outside.
			<br><br>
		<<elseif !kylarCafeAvailable()>>
			<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "left">>
		<<elseif $exposed lt 1 and getKylarLocation().area is "cafe">>
			<<endevent>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
			Kylar is sitting near the counter, drinking from a cup. When you look at <<him>>, <<he>> lowers the cup and smiles at you.
			<br>
			<<if !$daily.kylarCafeDate and kylarCafeAvailable(30) and setup.inflation.canAfford(400, "cafe")>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Have coffee with Kylar (0:30 <<printprice 400>>)|Kylar Cafe Date]]>><<set $daily.kylarCafeDate to true>><<set $dateCount.Total++>><<set $dateCount.Kylar++>><<money -400 "cafe">><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Kylar Cafe Visit
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "visiting">>
<<endevent>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
As you begin working, Kylar comes through the door. You look up when <<he>> enters, and <<he>> stops walking as soon as <<he>> sees you. <<He>> gives you a small wave.
<br><br>
<<if $kylar.cafeVisitDay is Time.date.midnight.timeStamp>>
	"I-I said I'd come," <<he>> says.
<<else>>
	"I-I didn't know you were working today," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> walks over to a table where <<he>> can still see you behind the counter and sits down. <<He>> picks up the menu and opens it, but <<hes>> so nervous that <<he>> doesn't notice <<hes>> holding it upside down.
<br><br>
<<if passage() is "Kylar Cafe Visit Chef">>
	<<link [[Next|Chef Work]]>><<endevent>><<unset $kylar_action $kylar.cafeVisitDay>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Ocean Breeze Work]]>><<endevent>><<unset $kylar_action $kylar.cafeVisitDay>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Kylar Cafe Visit Chef
<<include "Kylar Cafe Visit">>

:: Kylar Cafe Date
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "visiting">>
<<endevent>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
You carry two cups of coffee to a table near the window and put them down. Kylar pulls a chair away from the table for you. After you sit down, <<he>> looks at the other chairs, unsure which one to choose.
<br><br>
"You can sit here," you say, pointing to the chair beside yours.
<br><br>
Kylar smiles and quickly takes the seat next to you. <<He>> accidentally bumps the table while sitting down, making the spoon on <<his>> small coffee plate move and make a noise.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Kylar Cafe Date Coffee]]>><</link>>

:: Kylar Cafe Date Coffee
<<effects>>
You spend some time looking out the window, watching people walk past the café. Kylar sits quietly beside you, occasionally looking at you instead of the people outside. <<He>> hasn't taken a drink from <<his>> coffee yet.
<br><br>
"Don't you like your coffee?" you ask.
<br><br>
"Oh! I do!" <<He>> quickly picks up the cup and takes a sip, but the coffee is still too hot. <<He>> makes a face and puts the cup back down.
<br><br>
"It's good! But... hot," <<he>> explains, looking a little embarrassed. After a moment, <<he>> smiles at you. "I-I like being here. With you."
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold Kylar's hand (0:30)|Kylar Cafe Date End]]>><<set $kylar_action to "cafeHand">><<npcincr Kylar love 2>><<npcincr Kylar rage -2>><<stress -10>><<pass 30>><</link>><<glove>><<lksuspicion>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<link [[Talk over your coffee (0:30)|Kylar Cafe Date End]]>><<unset $kylar_action>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<stress -6>><<pass 30>><</link>><<glove>><<lstress>>
<br>

:: Kylar Cafe Date End
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<if $kylar_action is "cafeHand">>
	You reach under the table and take Kylar's hand. <<He>> looks down at your hands, then gently holds yours. <<He>> seems happy to stay like this, so you let <<him>> hold your hand for a while before giving it a gentle squeeze.
	<br><br>
	You remind <<him>> to drink <<his>> coffee before it gets cold.
<<else>>
	You ask Kylar about <<his>> drawings. <<He>> tries to explain them, but sometimes stops halfway through a sentence because <<he>> doesn't know what to say.
	<br><br>
	You keep listening and asking questions, which seems to help <<him>> relax. Soon, <<he>> starts talking more and even tells you about some of <<his>> other drawings.
	When you mention a place you like, <<he>> takes out <<his>> sketchbook and asks you to describe what it looks like.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !kylarCafeAvailable()>>
	Kylar looks at <<his>> watch. "I need to go. They're waiting for me."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks at you, then down at <<his>> unfinished coffee. <<He>> stays in <<his>> chair for a little longer before finally standing up.
	<<He>> leaves with half of <<his>> coffee still in the cup.
	<<set $daily.kylarCafe to "left">><br>
<<else>>
	After you both finish your coffee, Kylar pulls <<his>> chair a little closer to you.
	<br><br>
	"Could we do this again tomorrow?" <<he>> asks. "O-Or another day, if you want."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Say you can|Kylar Cafe Tomorrow Yes]]>><<set $kylar.cafeVisitDay to Time.tomorrow.midnight.timeStamp>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Say you can't|Kylar Cafe Tomorrow No]]>><<unset $kylar.cafeVisitDay>><<npcincr Kylar love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<if !kylarCafeAvailable() or $oceanbreezejob isnot 1>>
	<<link [[Finish your coffee|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><<unset $kylar_action>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Kylar Cafe Tomorrow Yes
<<effects>>
"Yes, I'll be working here tomorrow," you say.
<br><br>
Kylar quickly looks up at you. "Y-you will? Then I'll come and see you tomorrow!"
<br><br>
<<He>> smiles, then looks down at the empty cups on the table, still looking happy.
<br><br>
<<link [[Finish your coffee|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><<unset $kylar_action>><</link>>

:: Kylar Cafe Tomorrow No
<<effects>>
"No, I won't be working here tomorrow," you say.
<br><br>
"Oh..." Kylar looks down at <<his>> cup. "I was hoping I could see you here again."
<br><br>
<<link [[Finish your coffee|Ocean Breeze]]>><<endevent>><<unset $kylar_action>><</link>>
